---
import "../styles/cfs.css";
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/$/, "");
const photos = [
	["54480461965", "Isaac", "年會講堂 / Conference auditorium"],
	["54476961507", "OnCloud", "企業攤位 / Partner booth"],
	["54480174414", "月太", "技術分享 / Technical talk"],
	["54478178640", "月太", "社群交流 / Community discussion"]
];
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-Hant">
	<head><meta charset="UTF-8" /><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" /><meta name="robots" content="noindex" /><title>影像來源 / Photo credits · SITCON 2027</title></head><body>
		<main class="wrap section-pad">
			<a class="text-link" href={`${base}/`}>← SITCON 2027</a><h1 style="margin-top:32px">影像來源<br />Photo credits</h1><p style="margin-block:24px">
				本網站使用的活動照片由 SITCON 社群攝影夥伴提供。以下照片拍攝於 SITCON 2025，依網頁版面裁切呈現，依 <a class="text-link" href="https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/">CC BY-SA 2.0</a> 使用；圖片授權獨立於網站程式碼授權。
			</p><p>The following SITCON 2025 photographs are cropped for the web layout and used under CC BY-SA 2.0. Photo licensing is separate from the website’s code license.</p><ul>
				{
					photos.map(([id, author, title]) => (
						<li style="margin-top:20px">
							<a class="text-link" href={`https://www.flickr.com/photos/sitcon/${id}`} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">
								{title} — {author} / SITCON ↗
							</a>
						</li>
					))
				}
			</ul><p style="margin-top:30px">其他品項照片與示意圖沿用 SITCON 徵求書既有素材。 / Other option photos and illustrations are retained from SITCON’s existing prospectus.</p>
		</main>
	</body>
</html>
